# Versioning Discipline

**Version number updates require explicit user approval**:
- Do NOT automatically update version numbers in `manifest.yaml`, `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, or any other files
- ONLY update version numbers when the user explicitly requests it (e.g., "bump version to X.Y.Z")
- If a code change warrants a version bump, mention it in the response but do NOT make the change automatically

## User-Facing Changes
- If user-facing change:
  - Update `CHANGELOG.md` once per release (only when explicitly requested)
  - Keep `manifest.yaml` version consistent with `CHANGELOG`

## Internal-Only Changes
- If internal-only change (CI/tests/refactor):
  - Do NOT bump `manifest.yaml` version unless explicitly requested by the user
